WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:07.007
Welcome to the 360 Dealer Portal — where Home Care Provider Services dealers order, quote and grow their business.

2
00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:15.009
Dealer Overview is your home page: purchases this year, recent orders, and purchases by month and by manufacturer.

3
00:00:15.011 --> 00:00:22.011
The menu across the top reaches every tool. This tour shows the main ones in about four minutes.

4
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:29.011
Start here — on this page and in Help & Training — replays this tour and the step-by-step walkthroughs.

5
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:35.020
Shop Products lists the manufacturers on your account.

6
00:00:35.021 --> 00:00:43.021
Open a line — or search any product name, model or part number in the search box at the top.

7
00:00:43.021 --> 00:00:52.021
Here is Dalton Medical: filter by category, sort, and switch between grid and list.

8
00:00:52.027 --> 00:00:59.027
Each card shows your own dealer price. The prices in this tour are examples.

9
00:00:59.039 --> 00:01:07.039
A product page has the photos, your price and every option for that model.

10
00:01:07.043 --> 00:01:15.043
From here: Add to cart, Print Brochure for your customer, or Add to a quote.

11
00:01:15.048 --> 00:01:25.048
Provider Reimbursement shows the published Medicare and Medicaid allowance for coded products, by state and ZIP.

12
00:01:25.049 --> 00:01:33.049
It is a reference: the biller confirms each code and the payer’s rules before submitting a claim.

13
00:01:33.058 --> 00:01:41.058
Add to a quote puts this exact product on your customer quote.

14
00:01:41.064 --> 00:01:51.064
For each line, choose the price your customer sees: the manufacturer’s MSRP, your saved retail price, or a one-time price.

15
00:01:51.070 --> 00:02:00.070
Save the quote, then Print / PDF or Email it. Your dealer cost never appears on the customer’s copy.

16
00:02:00.074 --> 00:02:07.074
Brochures work the same way from any product page — your dealership is the seller.

17
00:02:07.087 --> 00:02:15.087
Orders & Tracking lists every order with its PO and status.

18
00:02:15.088 --> 00:02:24.088
Open an order to see its lines and shipments, with carrier tracking once the manufacturer sends it.

19
00:02:24.092 --> 00:02:30.092
Reorder favorites and print any order for your records.

20
00:02:30.103 --> 00:02:39.103
Resources & Support starts with the Document Library: catalogs, manuals and warranty documents, searchable by model.

21
00:02:39.106 --> 00:02:47.106
Book in-service training with open times from HCPS, or send it as a request.

22
00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:56.110
Service, Parts & Warranty: choose the line and the request — parts, warranty, repair or a return — and attach photos.

23
00:02:56.115 --> 00:03:03.115
Every case and appointment, with its status, is in My Requests & Appointments.

24
00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:13.127
Find local referral sources lists clinicians near you who ordered a product code from Original Medicare — CMS’s published data.

25
00:03:13.132 --> 00:03:23.132
By default it searches 25 miles around your branch. The published allowance for the code is at the top; results are nearest first.

26
00:03:23.134 --> 00:03:31.134
“Withheld by CMS” means fewer than 11 — never zero. Copy office details to plan your visits.

27
00:03:31.148 --> 00:03:39.148
My Account holds your company details, locations, logo and manufacturer accounts.

28
00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:48.150
Help & Training has a how-to for every tool and What’s New. Start here replays this tour and the walkthroughs.

29
00:03:48.153 --> 00:03:56.157
Questions? Call HCPS at 888-626-3140, or use Contact HCPS support. Thanks for watching.
